OL,3,AMan charged with attack on Australian
OL,4,AMP as suspect's father says she is
OL,5,Afamily friend
OL,6,
OL,7,FLocal media earlier named the alleged
OL,8,Fattacker as environmental activist
OL,9,FBrendan Nugent. His father and his
OL,10,Fpartner said they had been friends with
OL,11,FHaines "for more than 20 years" and
OL,12,Fthanked residents and officers who
OL,13,Fhelped her after the "shocking and
OL,14,Fhorrific crime".
OL,16,FHaines remains in a critical condition
OL,17,Fafter surgery and is reported to have
OL,18,Flost one of her legs.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
