OL,3,A'Great result for Canada', says Carney
OL,4,Aas Alberta votes to reject separatism
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonday's referendum was the result of a
OL,7,Fmonths-long campaign by separatists in
OL,8,Fthe western Canadian province to get a
OL,9,Fpublic vote on the issue.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
